cts had 2,319,640 inhabitants at the 2020 census while the whole municipality contained approximately 5,260,951 people.","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/63/Xiangyang%2C_Hubei%2C_China.jpg/330px-Xiangyang%2C_Hubei%2C_China.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xiangyang"},"twins":["Q41087","Q37333","Q216638","Q1195207","Q1938153","Q2592","Q503411","Q941870"],"climate":{"temp":[2.9,6.1,12,18,23,27.3,29.2,28.1,23.3,17.6,10.8,4.5],"rain":[21,26,43,72,103,111,157,132,85,69,40,16],"cloud":[62,66,68,70,73,73,73,66,67,63,59,56]}}